<title>TANZANIA: Fourteen people killed in bus crash in Tanzania.</title>
<headline>Fourteen people killed in bus crash in Tanzania.</headline>
<dateline>DAR ES SALAAM 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fourteen people were killed and 51 injured on Wednesday when two buses crashed head-on east of the Tanzanian capital Dar es Salaam, police said on Thursday.</p>
</text>
